  "summary": {
    "plain": "CDEX-10 searched its data for dark matter lighter than a proton interacting in unusual ways and found no signal.",
    "technical": "205 kg day from a p-type point-contact germanium detector; neutral-current fermionic DM absorption and DM-nucleus 3->2 scattering analysed with a 160 eVee threshold; no significant signal; limits extend to DM masses of 5 MeV/c^2 and 14 MeV/c^2 for the 3->2 scenarios."
  },
